  <main>
    <section class="hero section-shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-art" aria-hidden="true"><div class="moon"></div><div class="warrior-silhouette"></div><div class="slash slash-one"></div><div class="slash slash-two"></div></div>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> Équipe compétitive · Honor of Kings</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title"><span>SUICIDE</span><strong>CREW</strong></h1>
        <p class="hero-kicker">UN NOM. UNE ÉQUIPE. UNE LÉGENDE.</p>
        <p class="hero-lead">La prochaine bataille commence maintenant. Suivez notre épopée, nos combats et les joueurs qui refusent de reculer.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="pages/exploits.html">Voir nos exploits <span>↗</span></a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="pages/equipe.html">Découvrir la team <span>→</span></a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-side-note">生<br>存<br>競<br>技</div>
      <a href="#team" class="scroll-cue" aria-label="Découvrir la suite"><span>↓</span><small>SCROLL POUR ENTRER</small></a>
      <div class="hero-bottom-meta"><span>SC / 2025</span><span>HOK · FR</span><span>SAISON 01</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="intro section-shell" id="team">
      <div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">01 / identité</p><h2>Pas juste une équipe.<br><em>Un état d’esprit.</em></h2></div>
      <div class="intro-copy"><p>Suicide Crew est une équipe compétitive sur <strong>Honor of Kings</strong>. Nous jouons pour l’impact, nous progressons dans l’ombre et nous laissons les résultats écrire le reste.</p><a class="text-link" href="pages/equipe.html">Rencontrer les membres <span>↗</span></a></div>
      <div class="player-grid" id="equipe-grid">
        <article class="player-card featured"><div class="player-portrait portrait-one"><span>SC</span></div><div class="player-info"><span class="role">CAPITAINE · MID</span><h3>Overgamer</h3><p>« Toujours un coup d’avance. »</p><div class="tags"><b>Milady</b><b>Angela</b></div></div><span class="card-index">01</span></article>
        <article class="player-card"><div class="player-portrait portrait-two"><span>SC</span></div><div class="player-info"><span class="role">JUNGLE</span><h3>Yuna</h3><p>Instinct. Vitesse. Impact.</p><div class="tags"><b>Nakroth</b><b>Butterfly</b></div></div><span class="card-index">02</span></article>
        <article class="player-card"><div class="player-portrait portrait-three"><span>SC</span></div><div class="player-info"><span class="role">SUPPORT</span><h3>Orii</h3><p>Le calme avant la tempête.</p><div class="tags"><b>Dolores</b><b>Yaria</b></div></div><span class="card-index">03</span></article>
        <article class="player-card"><div class="player-portrait portrait-four"><span>SC</span></div><div class="player-info"><span class="role">ADC · MEMBRE 04</span><h3>Membre 04</h3><p>Placeholder à remplacer.</p><div class="tags"><b>À définir</b><b>À définir</b></div></div><span class="card-index">04</span></article>
        <article class="player-card"><div class="player-portrait portrait-five"><span>SC</span></div><div class="player-info"><span class="role">SOLO LANE · MEMBRE 05</span><h3>Membre 05</h3><p>Placeholder à remplacer.</p><div class="tags"><b>À définir</b><b>À définir</b></div></div><span class="card-index">05</span></article>
        <article class="player-card"><div class="player-portrait portrait-six"><span>SC</span></div><div class="player-info"><span class="role">FLEX · MEMBRE 06</span><h3>Membre 06</h3><p>Placeholder à remplacer.</p><div class="tags"><b>À définir</b><b>À définir</b></div></div><span class="card-index">06</span></article>
      </div>
      <div class="section-foot"><span>Roster en construction</span><span class="line"></span><span>Profils définitifs bientôt</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="matches section-shell" id="exploits">
      <div class="section-top"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">02 / derniers combats</p><h2>La mémoire<br><em>des batailles.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="pages/classement.html">Voir le hall of fame <span>↗</span></a></div>
      <div class="match-layout"><div class="featured-match"><div class="match-cover"><span class="match-status">VICTOIRE</span><span class="match-date">20.10.2025</span><div class="versus"><strong>SC</strong><b>3 — 1</b><strong>DRG</strong></div><p>Suicide Crew vs Dragons</p></div><div class="match-caption"><div><small>COMPÉTITION · SCRIM</small><h3>Une victoire qui laisse une trace.</h3></div><span>↗</span></div></div>
        <div class="match-list"><div class="match-list-head"><span>RÉSULTATS RÉCENTS</span><span>W / L</span></div><article class="result-row"><span class="result-logo">SC</span><div><b>SC <i>vs</i> Nova Esports</b><small>15.10.2025 · Scrim</small></div><strong class="loss">1 — 3</strong></article><article class="result-row"><span class="result-logo">SC</span><div><b>SC <i>vs</i> Eternal</b><small>10.10.2025 · Tournoi</small></div><strong>3 — 2</strong></article><article class="result-row"><span class="result-logo">SC</span><div><b>SC <i>vs</i> Zenith</b><small>05.10.2025 · Scrim</small></div><strong class="loss">2 — 3</strong></article><a class="list-link" href="pages/exploits.html">Tous les combats <span>→</span></a></div></div>
    </section>

    <section class="live-section section-shell" id="live"><div class="live-header"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="live-dot"></span> 03 / en direct</p><h2>Watch the<br><em>next move.</em></h2></div><div class="live-clock"><span>PROCHAIN MATCH</span><b>26 OCT · 20:30</b><small>SC vs Nova Esports</small></div></div><div class="live-card"><div class="live-preview"><div class="map-lines"></div><span class="stream-badge">● LIVE SOON</span><button class="play-btn" type="button" aria-label="Prévisualisation du direct">▶</button><span class="preview-label">HONOR OF KINGS · MATCH 04</span></div><div class="live-details"><p>REGARDEZ NOS COMBATS EN DIRECT ET EN REPLAY.</p><h3>Chaque seconde compte.</h3><a class="btn btn-primary" href="pages/recrutement.html">Rejoindre la communauté <span>↗</span></a></div></div></section>

    <section class="ranking section-shell" id="classement"><div class="section-top"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">04 / classement</p><h2>Les chiffres<br><em>parlent.</em></h2></div><div class="tabs" role="tablist"><button class="tab active" data-tab="team-tab" role="tab">Équipe</button><button class="tab" data-tab="individual-tab" role="tab">Individuel</button></div></div><div class="rank-panel" id="team-tab"><div class="rank-head"><span>#</span><span>Équipe</span><span>V</span><span>D</span><span>PTS</span></div><div class="rank-row leader"><b>1</b><span><i class="mini-logo">SC</i> Suicide Crew</span><strong>12</strong><strong>2</strong><strong>36</strong></div><div class="rank-row"><b>2</b><span><i class="mini-logo muted">DR</i> Dragons</span><strong>10</strong><strong>4</strong><strong>30</strong></div><div class="rank-row"><b>3</b><span><i class="mini-logo muted">NE</i> Nova Esports</span><strong>9</strong><strong>5</strong><strong>27</strong></div><div class="rank-row"><b>4</b><span><i class="mini-logo muted">ET</i> Eternal</span><strong>7</strong><strong>7</strong><strong>21</strong></div><div class="rank-row"><b>5</b><span><i class="mini-logo muted">ZH</i> Zenith</span><strong>5</strong><strong>9</strong><strong>15</strong></div><div class="stats-strip"><div><small>TAUX DE VICTOIRE</small><b>85<span>%</span></b></div><div><small>KDA MOYEN</small><b>7.2</b></div><div><small>MATCHS JOUÉS</small><b>14</b></div><div><small>SÉRIE ACTUELLE</small><b>W4</b></div></div></div><div class="rank-panel hidden" id="individual-tab"><div class="rank-head"><span>#</span><span>Joueur</span><span>KDA</span><span>WIN</span><span>FORME</span></div><div class="rank-row leader"><b>1</b><span><i class="mini-logo">OG</i> Overgamer</span><strong>8.4</strong><strong>92%</strong><strong>HOT</strong></div><div class="rank-row"><b>2</b><span><i class="mini-logo">YU</i> Yuna</span><strong>7.8</strong><strong>86%</strong><strong>UP</strong></div><div class="rank-row"><b>3</b><span><i class="mini-logo">OR</i> Orii</span><strong>6.9</strong><strong>82%</strong><strong>STABLE</strong></div></div></section>

    <section class="recruitment section-shell" id="recrutement"><div class="recruit-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>JOIN</span></div><div class="recruit-copy"><p class="eyebrow">05 / recrutement</p><h2>Ta place est<br><em>peut-être ici.</em></h2><p>Tu joues pour gagner, mais surtout pour progresser ? Les portes de la Crew sont ouvertes aux profils qui veulent construire quelque chose de légendaire.</p><div class="recruit-meta"><span><b>01</b> Niveau compétitif</span><span><b>02</b> Mental d’équipe</span><span><b>03</b> Disponibilité</span></div><button class="btn btn-primary" type="button" data-modal-open="apply-modal">Envoyer ma candidature <span>↗</span></button></div></section>

    <section class="gallery section-shell" id="galerie"><div class="section-top"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">06 / galerie</p><h2>Fragments<br><em>de la Crew.</em></h2></div><a class="text-link" href="pages/live.html">Voir tous les médias <span>↗</span></a></div><div class="gallery-grid"><div class="gallery-tile tile-wide"><span>SC / MOMENTS</span><b>NO REST<br>NO REGRETS</b></div><div class="gallery-tile tile-tall"><span>SC / ARENA</span><b>THE<br>HUNT</b></div><div class="gallery-tile tile-small"><span>SC / REPLAY</span><b>CLUTCH<br>PLAY</b></div><div class="gallery-tile tile-small alt"><span>SC / CREW</span><b>ONE<br>UNIT</b></div></div></section>
  </main>

