  <div class="modal" id="login-modal" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-card"><button class="modal-close" data-modal-close aria-label="Fermer">×</button><p class="eyebrow">ESPACE PRIVÉ</p><h2>Connexion<br><em>membre.</em></h2><p class="modal-note">Interface de démonstration. L’authentification réelle sera ajoutée avec Django.</p><form data-demo-form><label>Pseudo ou e-mail<input type="text" placeholder="overgamer@suicidecrew.gg" required></label><label>Mot de passe<input type="password" placeholder="••••••••" required></label><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Se connecter <span>↗</span></button></form><a href="#recrutement" data-modal-close>Pas encore membre ? Rejoins la Crew.</a></div></div>
  <div class="modal" id="apply-modal" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-card"><button class="modal-close" data-modal-close aria-label="Fermer">×</button><p class="eyebrow">RECRUTEMENT</p><h2>Entre dans<br><em>la légende.</em></h2><form data-demo-form><label>Pseudo<input type="text" placeholder="Ton pseudo" required></label><label>Rôle recherché<select required><option value="">Sélectionner</option><option>Jungle</option><option>Mid</option><option>Support</option><option>ADC</option><option>Solo lane</option></select></label><label>Message<textarea placeholder="Parle-nous de toi…" required></textarea></label><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Envoyer ma candidature <span>↗</span></button></form></div></div>
  <div class="toast" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
